sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant G as AXME Cloud Gateway
    participant I as Identity Validator
    participant Z as Authorization Engine
    participant A as Audit/Trace

    Note over C,A: Per-request auth enforcement

    C->>G: API request
    G->>I: validate machine key (x-api-key / AXME_API_KEY)
    alt x-api-key invalid or missing
        I-->>G: reject
        G-->>C: 401 missing_platform_api_key / invalid_platform_api_key
    else x-api-key valid
        I-->>G: ok
        G->>I: validate actor token (if required on route)
        alt actor token invalid/missing/scope mismatch
            I-->>G: reject
            G-->>C: 401/403 missing_actor_token / invalid_actor_scope
        else identity context valid
            G->>Z: enforce owner scope + role/grants
            alt unauthorized
                Z-->>G: deny
                G-->>C: 403 forbidden
            else authorized
                Z-->>G: allow
                G->>A: record audit + trace metadata
                G-->>C: execute and return response
            end
        end
    end

    Note over C,A: Token refresh (CLI proactive, before exp − now < 60s)

    C->>G: POST /v1/auth/refresh { refresh_token } + x-api-key
    G->>I: validate refresh_token (one-time-use, 30-day TTL)
    alt refresh_token invalid or expired
        I-->>G: reject
        G-->>C: 401 invalid refresh token → re-login via OTP required
    else valid
        I->>I: rotate: new access_token (15 min) + new refresh_token (30 day)<br/>old refresh_token invalidated immediately
        G-->>C: { access_token, refresh_token, expires_in: 900 }
    end
